  "excerpt": "Five days of small discoveries: café stops, Universal, the city at night, and more shopping bags than planned.",
  "html": "<p class=\"travel-kicker\">Singapore · July 2026 · five days</p><p class=\"travel-intro\">A five-day Singapore trip with my sister: cafés, Universal Studios, long walks, city lights and—predictably—far more shopping than either of us planned.</p><p>Singapore felt built for wandering without a plan. One minute we were finding colour in old shophouses, the next cooling off inside a café, taking the MRT somewhere new, or adding another bag to the hotel-room pile.</p><div class=\"travel-gallery\"><figure class=\"travel-shot wide\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/01-flight.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/01-flight-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/01-flight-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/01-flight.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Flight from Mumbai to Singapore\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>First frame: Mumbai to Singapore.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/02-collectible.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/02-collectible-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/02-collectible-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/02-collectible.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1755\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A collectible Coca-Cola can on a café table\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Small finds along the way.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/03-haji-lane.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/03-haji-lane-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/03-haji-lane-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/03-haji-lane.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colourful Haji Lane in Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Haji Lane, full of colour.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot wide\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/04-universal.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/04-universal-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/04-universal-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/04-universal.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Popcorn truck at Universal Studios Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Universal Studios, exactly as extra as it should be.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/05-ice-cream.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/05-ice-cream-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/05-ice-cream-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/05-ice-cream.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2845\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Colourful ice cream shop ceiling in Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>A very good ice-cream stop.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/06-shophouses.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/06-shophouses-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/06-shophouses-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/06-shophouses.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Pastel shophouses in Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Pastel streets and blue skies.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/07-street-side.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/07-street-side-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/07-street-side-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/07-street-side.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Street vendor in Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Everyday street scenes.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/08-piano.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/08-piano-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/08-piano-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/08-piano.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Piano at Gardens by the Bay MRT station\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>A quiet MRT-station piano moment.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot wide\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/09-gardens.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/09-gardens-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/09-gardens-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/09-gardens.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Supertrees at Gardens by the Bay at night\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Gardens by the Bay after dark.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/10-night-pizza.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/10-night-pizza-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/10-night-pizza-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/10-night-pizza.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Pizza bar at night in Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Late-night food, bright blue lights.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/11-cafe.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/11-cafe-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/11-cafe-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/11-cafe.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Café interior in Singapore\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>One of many good café breaks.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot wide\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/12-jewel.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/12-jewel-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/12-jewel-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/12-jewel.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Jewel Changi waterfall and greenery\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Jewel: airport, rainforest, waterfall.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/13-souvenirs.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/13-souvenirs-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/13-souvenirs-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/13-souvenirs.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Singapore souvenir store\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Last-minute souvenirs.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"travel-shot\"><img src=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/14-shopping.webp\" srcset=\"../images/travel/singapore-2026/14-shopping-480.webp 480w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/14-shopping-800.webp 800w, ../images/travel/singapore-2026/14-shopping.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) calc((100vw - 48px) / 2), 370px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2845\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Shopping bags in a Singapore hotel room\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Proof that shopping was part of itinerary.</figcaption></figure></div><h2>What I’m taking back</h2><p>Not a perfectly planned guide. More a collection of moments: a city that moves fast but leaves room for detours, good food and tiny surprises. Best part, though, was doing it all with my sister.</p>"
